cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use DynaFX in your research, please cite it as follows."
title: "DynaFX"
abstract: >-
  A multi-paradigm simulation framework (System Dynamics, Agent-Based
  Modeling, Discrete Event Simulation) with a semantic knowledge engine
  (RDF/OWL/SPARQL). The KB and simulation form one connected system:
  knowledge graph to parameters, multi-paradigm simulation, evidence
  triples back into the graph, then rules and optimization.
keywords:
  - system dynamics
  - agent-based modeling
  - discrete-event simulation
  - knowledge graph
  - RDF
  - OWL
  - SPARQL
  - semantic simulation
license: MIT
type: software
version: 0.2.0
date-released: "2026-08-02"
authors:
